NexaCorp Corporate Data & Acceptable Use Policy 2026

1. Intellectual Property
All code, system designs, and internal documentation created by employees remain the sole property of NexaCorp.

2. Access Control
Access to server configuration files is strictly forbidden for standard users.
All administrative access requires multi-factor authentication and supervisor approval.

3. Monitoring
All requests to internal portals are logged, audited, and retained for 90 days.
